  keywords = {金属间化合物, 抗拉强度, 铝钢连接, 激光焊, 界面调控, 断裂位置, 中间层},
  abstract = {By Zn addition to the fusion zone, the interfacial intermetallic compounds (IMCs) of laser Al/steel joint changed from layered Fe2Al5 and needle-like FeAl3 to layered Fe2Al5 xZnx and dispersed FeZn10 with minor Al-rich amorphous phase. This resulted in an improvement in the joint strength and the change of failure mode.}
